{"seq":47,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0693"},"reason":"The body said the iron in haem gives blood its red colour. That is a common misconception: the colour comes from haem's porphyrin ring with the iron bound to it, not from the iron alone. The sentence now says so in EN/DE/RU. The answer 'red' is unchanged and its spans moved with the sentence.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hemoglobin"},{"url":"https://www.dictionary.com/browse/hemoglobin"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",122],["-","The"],["+","Haem"],["=",1],["+","– strictly its porphyrin ring holding the iron, not the "],["=",2],["-","in"],["+","itself"],["=",1],["-","haem"],["+","–"],["=",1048]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",116],["+","Häm – genauer sein Porphyrinring, der das "],["=",2],["-","im"],["+","hält,"],["=",1],["-","Häm"],["+","nicht"],["=",1],["+","das Eisen selbst – "],["=",973]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",104],["-","Железо"],["+","Гем"],["=",1],["-","в"],["+","—"],["=",1],["-","геме"],["+","точнее,"],["=",1],["+","его порфириновое кольцо, удерживающее железо, а не само железо, — "],["=",885]]}],"hash":"f8bf12b05a63","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"aa5c3108e91852d677a7bd96f2b8ac1dac256f810720e9a8319aede6d66d27ef"},
